{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VizuL</strong> is an urban fantasy wherein the in-universe magic system integrates to the gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mirtilo is a very troubled girl. She left her home behind to search for her missing parents. That same morning, moments later, her cousin Garoa pays her beloved relatives a visit to find them missing almost without a trace! No one is around and there's some evil entity out there. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Come along this whimsical, colorful adventure with the two cousins seeking answers at their own pace.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967680/extras/4ad349a195fed0133fdf757c0e4e2c32.poster.avif?t=1772739675\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967680/extras/4ad349a195fed0133fdf757c0e4e2c32.webm?t=1772739675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Features</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 main difficulty modes:\u00a0Easy, Regular, Hard and Ultimate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 stages throughout the main game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >linear storyline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 playable characters\u00a0with different stats, abilities and dialog for their respective scenarios</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >checkpoints at bosses' attacks, meaning that you restart from the attack you died to</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >couple puzzles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >for more details, consult the <i>README.txt</i>\u00a0file within the game's folder, as well as the in-game instructions that can be viewed from the menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967680/extras/873f96a047736dfb8f6df0e032944e81.poster.avif?t=1772739675\" width=640 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967680/extras/873f96a047736dfb8f6df0e032944e81.webm?t=1772739675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967680/extras/873f96a047736dfb8f6df0e032944e81.mp4?t=1772739675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3967680?t=1772739675","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967680/9a6e1d2a92f1926d489a4238a3c3c0892d67a284/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772739675","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967680/336c950415ad0990afd15a7c18e8608da34022c7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772739675","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967680/336c950415ad0990afd15a7c18e8608da34022c7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772739675","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":" - blood, violence, a little gore.\r\n - brief mention of an attempted sexual assault\r\n - cruelty, verbal and emotional abuse.\r\n - cursing\r\n - drug mentions and consumption.\r\n - instances of predatory age gaps and relationships.\r\n - racism and its pertaining discussions.\r\n - suicide ideation.\r\n - use of homoph